00:40:21.063 --> 00:40:22.908
boss, to sit down and watch it."

00:40:22.919 --> 00:40:25.340
So, um, truly, truly thank you.

00:40:25.353 --> 00:40:28.761
For those that have not already
posted your questions in the

00:40:28.764 --> 00:40:31.150
Q&A, please go ahead and do so.

