00:45:21.302 --> 00:45:24.488
Um, either way this person kinda feels
like that might be somewhat of an

00:45:24.492 --> 00:45:26.620
improvement over the current situation.

00:45:26.874 --> 00:45:28.265
Uh, but what are your thoughts on that?

